WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,210
Why does this hot water smell like rust?

2
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:06,650
And the water pressure is so low

3
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,530
Just get used to it

4
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:09,930
Our bureau’s funds

5
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,730
Most of it was spent on equipment and scientific research.

6
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,010
What about logistics?

7
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,410
Naturally, we have to save food and reduce consumption.

8
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,170
And this hot water is actually supplied

9
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,490
Stopped the habit after 11pm

10
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:23,460
Why should I get used to you?

11
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,420
I will write a written report on my dissatisfaction

12
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,180
Submit it directly to the logistics department tomorrow morning

13
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,580
I want them to know

14
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,020
The legitimate rights and interests of new medical students

15
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:30,980
is inviolable

16
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:40,450
Wake up fat man

17
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:42,290
Wake up, check out

18
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,580
What bill to settle?

19
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,200
Noise mental damage fee?

20
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,480
Starting at 11:45 last night

21
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,560
You snored for a total of four and a half hours
